---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Academy — Hexfield" description="A preview of Hexfield Academy: planned Active Directory practice sets and in depth cybersecurity interview notes.">
  <section class="academy-hero wrap">
    <div class="academy-hero-copy"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span> HEXFIELD ACADEMY / PREVIEW</div><h1>Learn the system.<br /><em>Prove the thinking.</em></h1><p>Go beyond a list of commands. The Academy is being designed around two skills: working through connected Active Directory scenarios and explaining technical decisions with clarity.</p><div class="academy-hero-actions"><a class="button button-primary" href="#paths">Explore the paths <span aria-hidden="true">↘</span></a><span>CONTENT IN DEVELOPMENT</span></div></div>
    <div class="academy-hero-art" aria-hidden="true"><div class="art-orbit art-orbit-one"></div><div class="art-orbit art-orbit-two"></div><div class="art-orbit art-orbit-three"></div><div class="art-core">H<span>✳</span></div><span class="art-label art-label-one">PRACTICE / 01</span><span class="art-label art-label-two">EXPLAIN / 02</span><span class="art-cross art-cross-one">+</span><span class="art-cross art-cross-two">+</span></div>
  </section>
  <div class="academy-ticker"><div class="wrap"><span>THE PATH</span><span>FOUNDATIONS <b>→</b> SCENARIOS <b>→</b> EXPLANATION</span><span>BUILT FOR DEPTH</span></div></div>
  <section class="academy-paths wrap" id="paths"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="section-kicker">TWO WAYS TO GO DEEPER / 01</div><h2>Choose your mode<span class="title-stop">.</span></h2></div><p>Each path is being designed as a focused learning product. These pages show the proposed structure while the material is in development.</p></div>
    <div class="academy-path-grid">
      <a class="academy-path-card path-ad" href="/academy/ad-sets/"><div class="path-card-top"><span>01 / ACTIVE DIRECTORY</span><span>↗</span></div><div class="path-icon path-icon-network" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="path-card-body"><span class="academy-status">IN DEVELOPMENT</span><h3>AD Set Labs</h3><p>Connected, OSCP-style lab scenarios with an emphasis on enumeration, identity, trust, evidence, and decision making.</p><span class="path-cta">See the lab blueprint <b>↗</b></span></div></a>
      <a class="academy-path-card path-interview" href="/academy/interview-notes/"><div class="path-card-top"><span>02 / INTERVIEW PREP</span><span>↗</span></div><div class="path-icon path-icon-questions" aria-hidden="true"><strong>Q<span>.</span></strong><small>WHY? / HOW? / WHAT IF?</small></div><div class="path-card-body"><span class="academy-status">IN DEVELOPMENT</span><h3>Interview Notes</h3><p>Question led study packs with short answers, deeper mechanics, common follow ups, and links back to the fundamentals.</p><span class="path-cta">See the note format <b>↗</b></span></div></a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="academy-flow wrap"><div class="academy-flow-header"><span>HOW IT FITS TOGETHER / 02</span><h2>One connected learning loop<span class="title-stop">.</span></h2></div><div class="academy-flow-grid"><div><span>01</span><h3>Understand</h3><p>Build the mental model with the free roadmap and field notes.</p><a href="/roadmap/">Open the roadmap ↗</a></div><div><span>02</span><h3>Investigate</h3><p>Apply the model in a scoped, realistic Active Directory scenario.</p><a href="/academy/ad-sets/">View AD Set Labs ↗</a></div><div><span>03</span><h3>Explain</h3><p>Turn your findings into clear answers you can defend in an interview.</p><a href="/academy/interview-notes/">View Interview Notes ↗</a></div></div></section>
  <section class="academy-end wrap"><div><span>START WHERE YOU ARE</span><h2>The free field guide is already open.</h2></div><a class="button button-primary" href="/notes/">Read the field notes <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></section>
</Base>
